      "mergeID": "6af5df285dea03d10ca3acd0",
      "mergedPostDetails": "For UDON admin interfaces or whitelisted areas  etc. it would be great to have GetUserID or something like that exposed, It's been a real struggle with people with special characters in their display name, UserIDs would make the process so much cleaner, and more reliable",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Allow us to get UserID of a VRCPlayer",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5eb6045ff9f4665cc1be132a",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't agree with this.  This is a slippery slope \n\nWhile the beneficial side is allowing an online white listed area ..\n\nIt can also be abused for malicious intent \n\nVrChat ToS says that creating a white list area is okay but maintaining a blacklist, especially when it prevents the user from enjoying the world that is publicly released can be done.\n\nImagine that you're friends with a VrChat game world creator.  You guys had a stupid falling out that had nothing to do with the game \n\nSome of your friends asked to join you to your former friends game world to have fun \n\nYou accept and enter the world.  Udon reads your username and insta teleports you to a blocked area \n\nWhile this may not prevent them from entering the world, this essentially creates a blacklist and punishment that a world creator that made a public world, can whimsically decide who can and can enter their public world \n\nIt's a slippery slope",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
