      "mergedPostDetails": "For UDON admin interfaces or whitelisted areas  etc. it would be great to have GetUserID or something like that exposed, It's been a real struggle with people with special characters in their display name, UserIDs would make the process so much cleaner, and more reliable",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Allow us to get UserID of a VRCPlayer",
      "parentID": null,
